# Carom — Versus

Versus is one of the two ways to play Carom, reached from `VERSUS` on the main
menu. It is two local players sharing the keyboard, player one on the left and
player two on the right.

## Controls

`specs/ui.md` states the eight actions the game reads, the keys each one is bound
to, and which screens read them. Each movement action moves its own player's
paddle alone.

- `up` is `1` while `p1-up` is held and `0` otherwise, and `down` is `1` while
  `p1-down` is held and `0` otherwise. Those two values drive player one's
  (left) paddle through the movement, integration, and clamp
  `specs/playfield.md` states.
- Player two's (right) paddle takes the same from `p2-up` and `p2-down`.
